### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/


### Créer un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "azerty123"
}

### Se connecter : on récupère le token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "azerty123"
}

### Sans token : doit répondre 401
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts


### Tous les contacts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Un contact 
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6adcac73cd3489bfd1eb7b52
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Créer un contact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "tete",
  "age": 30
}

### Modifier un contact 
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6adcac73cd3489bfd1eb7b52
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "age": 31
}

### Supprimer un contact
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6adcac73cd3489bfd1eb7b53
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
